# VIVEK MOMENTUM publishes <market>.json here, written by CI
# (.github/workflows/momentum.yml), never committed by hand.
#
# This directory is the lens's ENTIRE write-set, which is what makes the lens
# removable in one commit: `git rm -r scanner/momentum public/data/momentum`.
# `tests/test_momentum_fences.py` reads scanner/momentum/run.py and fails if it
# ever names a path outside here.
#
# It is deliberately a SUBDIRECTORY rather than public/data/<market>_momentum.json:
# nothing in the repo globs public/data/*.json today, but a subdirectory cannot
# be caught by one that appears later.
